# Cloudflare Workers & Durable Objects

- Entry: @src/server/index.ts — `Chat` class extends partyserver `Server`, hibernation enabled.
- Pure logic is extracted: @src/server/validate.ts, @src/server/chatLogic.ts, @src/server/presence.ts, @src/server/constants.ts.
- Validate all inbound WebSocket payloads via `parseInboundMessage` / `validateInboundMessage`.
- Messages persist in DO SQLite (`messages` table); max @src/shared.ts `MAX_MESSAGES` per room; 30-day TTL via alarm.
- Bindings and Durable Object lifecycle: @wrangler.jsonc — `Chat` is declared in `exports` with SQLite storage.
- No Node-only APIs in Worker code unless Workers-compatible.
- After binding changes: `bun run cf-typegen`.
- Tests mock `partyserver`: @src/server/index.test.ts, @src/server/validate.test.ts.
- Deploy: `bun run deploy`; observability enabled in wrangler config.
